      "acceptedVariants": [
        "ghar kahaan hai?"
      ],
      "explanation": "'Ghar kahaan hai?' — 'ghar' (house), 'kahaan' (where), 'hai' (is). In Hindi, question words do not usually change the word order; the tone rises to indicate a question.",
